      ],
      "text": "2.5 Systematic screening for TB disease in prisons",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.472900390625,
        363.8783874511719,
        112.26789855957031
      ],
      "text": "and other penitentiary institutions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        126.23969268798828,
        482.357177734375,
        140.6826934814453
      ],
      "text": "5. Systematic screening for TB disease should be conducted in prisons and penitentiary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        138.2397003173828,
        132.52069091796875,
        152.6826934814453
      ],
      "text": "institutions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        151.6977081298828,
        458.90887451171875,
        168.93470764160156
      ],
      "text": "updated recommendation: strong recommendation, very low certainty of evidence ( ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        196.40953063964844,
        328.5850830078125,
        214.67953491210938
      ],
      "text": "2.5.1 Summary of evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.38539123535156,
        527.390380859375,
        235.82838439941406
      ],
      "text": "People in prisons and other penitentiary institutions are at an increased risk for TB compared with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.58534240722656,
        527.4385986328125,
        249.02833557128906
      ],
      "text": "the general population, and they often have limited access to health care services. The estimated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.78529357910156,
        527.4390869140625,
        262.2283020019531
      ],
      "text": "incidence of TB among people residing in prisons is 23 times higher than that among the general",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.1912841796875,
        527.4388427734375,
        275.4283142089844
      ],
      "text": "(24) population  . Data reviewed for the GDG meeting suggest that screening in prisons may improve",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.1854248046875,
        527.390380859375,
        288.6284484863281
      ],
      "text": "early case detection, increase overall case detection and reduce TB prevalence. One observational",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.3853759765625,
        527.4073486328125,
        301.8283996582031
      ],
      "text": "study showed that a smaller proportion of TB patients in prisons whose disease was detected through",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980181694030762,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.5853271484375,
        527.3935546875,
        315.0283508300781
      ],
      "text": "screening were at an advanced stage of disease compared with those diagnosed through passive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.99127197265625,
        527.50830078125,
        328.2283020019531
      ],
      "text": "(25) case-finding services  . Two observational studies showed that TB screening in prisons may reduce",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.985490798950195,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.19134521484375,
        527.3876953125,
        341.4283447265625
      ],
      "text": "(26, 27) TB prevalence in the facilities  . One trial showed that screening in prisons may increase case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.39141845703125,
        227.11021423339844,
        354.62841796875
      ],
      "text": "(28) detection by more than 50%  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.8893127441406,
        527.4432373046875,
        376.33233642578125
      ],
      "text": "Based on this new evidence and the high risk of TB in this population, the GDG felt that this risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.97930908203125,
        527.4281616210938,
        389.5323181152344
      ],
      "text": "Web Annex B group now merited a strong recommendation for TB screening (see  , Table 4, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        388.1793212890625,
        527.4340209960938,
        402.7323303222656
      ],
      "text": "Web Annex C , Table 3). The GDG felt that implementing TB screening in prisons has the potential",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.48931884765625,
        527.4266967773438,
        415.9323425292969
      ],
      "text": "to increase equity in access to health care, particularly in settings where health services in prisons",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.6893005371094,
        144.63430786132812,
        429.13232421875
      ],
      "text": "are suboptimal.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.555908203125,
        301.5748596191406,
        457.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "2.5.2 Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.53179931640625,
        527.3992919921875,
        478.9748229980469
      ],
      "text": "A prisoner is anyone held in a criminal justice facility or correctional facility during the investigation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.7318115234375,
        527.4133911132812,
        492.1748352050781
      ],
      "text": "of a crime, anyone awaiting trial and anyone who has been sentenced. In addition, people residing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.9317932128906,
        527.39697265625,
        505.37481689453125
      ],
      "text": "in a correctional facility are almost always in close contact with several other inmates; thus, whenever",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.1318359375,
        527.4157104492188,
        518.5748291015625
      ],
      "text": "a person residing in a prison is diagnosed with TB, prisoners who have been in close contact with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        250.47459411621094,
        517.2218017578125,
        346.6860046386719,
        531.5767822265625
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.987192153930664,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.331787109375,
        527.3890991210938,
        531.7747802734375
      ],
      "text": "that person should be investigated (see  ). People who work in prisons and other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987192153930664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.5317993164062,
        524.423583984375,
        544.9747924804688
      ],
      "text": "penitentiary institutions are also at high risk of exposure to TB and should also be eligible for screening.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.956563949584961,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.2357177734375,
        527.4862060546875,
        566.6787109375
      ],
      "text": "At a minimum, screening in prisons and other penitentiary institutions should always include screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96579647064209,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        565.4356689453125,
        527.4378051757812,
        579.878662109375
      ],
      "text": "when a person enters a detention facility, annual screening and screening upon release to prevent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.6357421875,
        527.4013671875,
        593.0787353515625
      ],
      "text": "the reintroduction of TB into the broader community. Treatment and follow up after release should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.835693359375,
        148.91880798339844,
        606.2786865234375
      ],
      "text": "also be ensured.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.5396728515625,
        527.1293334960938,
        627.982666015625
      ],
      "text": "Screening in prisons should be combined with efforts to improve living conditions and provide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.7396850585938,
        527.2098999023438,
        641.1826782226562
      ],
      "text": "infection control measures. If possible, TB screening in prisons and other penitentiary institutions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.939697265625,
        527.6318359375,
        654.3826904296875
      ],
      "text": "should be combined with screening for other diseases, including HIV, and health-promotion activities",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991896629333496,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.1397094726562,
        527.4410400390625,
        667.5827026367188
      ],
      "text": "targeted towards people in these institutions. When starting screening, it is important to ensure that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.3397216796875,
        527.4113159179688,
        680.78271484375
      ],
      "text": "high-quality treatment and effective case management are in place, as well as effective mechanisms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.5396728515625,
        527.4111938476562,
        693.982666015625
      ],
      "text": "for continuing treatment after transfer or release. For recommendations on and operational aspects",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.7396850585938,
        527.6016845703125,
        707.1826782226562
      ],
      "text": "associated with TB care and prevention in prisons and other penitentiary institutions, see WHO’s",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.1456909179688,
        527.43896484375,
        720.3826904296875
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines for the control of tuberculosis in prisons (29) . However, even if TB management practices",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.1397094726562,
        527.4036254882812,
        733.5827026367188
      ],
      "text": "are suboptimal, screening may be initiated to assess the burden of undetected TB among inmates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        732.3397216796875,
        527.3968505859375,
        746.78271484375
      ],
      "text": "to provide a rationale for strengthening general diagnostic and treatment services for TB, as well as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.5396728515625,
        527.4046630859375,
        759.982666015625
      ],
      "text": "implementing measures to improve infection control and living conditions. In addition to systematic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        758.7396850585938,
        527.340576171875,
        773.1826782226562
      ],
      "text": "screening, any inmate who develops symptoms suggestive of TB should have easy access to diagnostic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.953953742980957,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.217041015625,
        136.43409729003906,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        796.217041015625,
        170.0604705810547,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        796.217041015625,
        226.65042114257812,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        49.47319793701172,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "18",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        805.8170166015625,
        219.03489685058594,
        816.3209838867188
      ],
      "text": "systematic screening for tuberculosis disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}